WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.140
My astronauts expected volcano rocks.

2
00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:17.140
Instead they kept finding rocks smashed together by giant impacts — the scientists had guessed wrong, and that's how science works.

3
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:23.690
Near me lies a photo of a family from Earth and the first telescope ever used on the Moon.

4
00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:28.000
A family photo lies in the dust beside me.
